            "content": [
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "16CC",
                "text": "Development of Scheduled Castes and Scheduled Tribes."
              },
              {
                "type": "note",
                "text": "Note The Ministry of Home Affairs will be the nodal Ministry for overall policy, planning and coordination of programmes of development for Scheduled [PART II--SEC. 3(ii)] Castes and Scheduled Tribes. In regard to sectoral programmes and schemes of development of these communities, policy planning, monitoring, evaluation, etc. as also their coordination will be the responsibility of the concerned Central Ministries, State Governments and Union Territory Administrations. Each Central Ministry and Department will be the nodal Ministry or Department concerning its sector."
              }
